{
  "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08",
  "nama": "Bank Soal Sulit - Paket 8",
  "kelas": 12,
  "kategori": "Matematika Tingkat Lanjut",
  "tingkat": "SULIT",
  "deskripsi": "Geometri analitik, trigonometri, dan kalkulus lanjutan",
  "versi": "1.0.0",
  "soal": [
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q01",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Grafik berikut menyatakan perubahan kedalaman air laut di sebuah teluk." },
        {
          "tipe": "image",
          "src": "images/kelas12/matematika-tingkat-lanjut/sulit/grafik-kedalaman-air.png",
          "caption": "Grafik fungsi kosinus kedalaman air laut y = a + b cos(πt/6) dengan titik puncak di (0, 14.3) dan (12, 14.3) serta titik minimum di (6, 10.3).",
          "width": "large"
        },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Pada grafik tersebut, $y$ menyatakan kedalaman air laut dalam meter, $t$ dalam jam, serta $a$ dan $b$ adalah konstanta. Nilai $t = 6$ menyatakan 6 jam setelah pukul 00.00. Waktu saat kedalaman air laut mencapai $12{,}3$ meter untuk ketiga kalinya setelah pukul 00.00 adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$3$ jam"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$9$ jam"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$10$ jam"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$12$ jam"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$15$ jam"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 4,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Tentukan konstanta $a$ dan $b$ dari nilai maksimum ($14{,}3$) dan minimum ($10{,}3$):" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "a = \\frac{14{,}3 + 10{,}3}{2} = 12{,}3, \\quad b = \\frac{14{,}3 - 10{,}3}{2} = 2" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Persamaan kedalaman air laut: $y = 12{,}3 + 2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}t\\right)$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Saat kedalaman $y = 12{,}3$ meter:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "12{,}3 = 12{,}3 + 2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}t\\right) \\implies \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}t\\right) = 0" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\frac{\\pi}{6}t = \\frac{\\pi}{2} + k\\pi \\implies t = 3 + 6k" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Urutan nilai $t$: $t_1 = 3$ (pertama), $t_2 = 9$ (kedua), $t_3 = 15$ (ketiga)." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q02",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Persamaan lingkaran yang berpusat di $(-2, 3)$ dan menyinggung garis $3x - 4y - 7 = 0$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$x^2 + y^2 + 4x - 6y - 12 = 0$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$x^2 + y^2 + 4x - 6y + 12 = 0$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$x^2 + y^2 - 4x + 6y - 12 = 0$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$x^2 + y^2 - 4x + 6y + 12 = 0$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$x^2 + y^2 + 4x + 6y + 12 = 0$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Hitung jari-jari $r$ sebagai jarak pusat $(-2, 3)$ ke garis $3x - 4y - 7 = 0$:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "r = \\frac{|3(-2) - 4(3) - 7|}{\\sqrt{3^2 + (-4)^2}} = \\frac{|-6 - 12 - 7|}{5} = \\frac{25}{5} = 5" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Persamaan lingkaran baku:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "(x+2)^2 + (y-3)^2 = 5^2 \\implies x^2 + 4x + 4 + y^2 - 6y + 9 = 25 \\implies x^2 + y^2 + 4x - 6y - 12 = 0" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q03",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Diketahui $\\sin A = \\frac{3}{5}$ dan $\\cos B = -\\frac{5}{13}$ dengan $A$ sudut lancip dan $B$ sudut tumpul. Nilai dari $\\sin(A - B)$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\frac{33}{65}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$-\\frac{33}{65}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\frac{63}{65}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$-\\frac{63}{65}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\frac{16}{65}$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 3,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "• Sudut $A$ lancip (Kuadran I): $\\sin A = \\frac{3}{5} \\implies \\cos A = \\frac{4}{5}$" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "• Sudut $B$ tumpul (Kuadran II): $\\cos B = -\\frac{5}{13} \\implies \\sin B = \\frac{12}{13}$" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Gunakan rumus pengurangan sudut sinus:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\sin(A-B) = \\sin A\\cos B - \\cos A\\sin B" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= \\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\left(-\\frac{5}{13}\\right) - \\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)\\left(\\frac{12}{13}\\right) = -\\frac{15}{65} - \\frac{48}{65} = -\\frac{63}{65}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q04",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Persamaan garis singgung lingkaran $x^2 + y^2 - 4x + 6y - 12 = 0$ yang tegak lurus terhadap garis $x + 2y - 5 = 0$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = 2x - 7 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = 2x - 1 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = -2x + 1 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = 2x + 5 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$y = -2x - 1 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5}$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Bentuk baku lingkaran: $(x-2)^2 + (y+3)^2 = 12 + 4 + 9 = 25$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Pusat $(2, -3)$ dan $r = 5$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Garis $x + 2y - 5 = 0$ memiliki gradien $m_1 = -\\frac{1}{2}$. Gradien garis singgung $m = 2$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "y - (-3) = 2(x - 2) \\pm 5\\sqrt{2^2 + 1}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "y + 3 = 2x - 4 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5} \\implies y = 2x - 7 \\pm 5\\sqrt{5}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q05",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Nilai dari $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\tan 8x \\cdot \\sin 2x}{x \\cdot \\tan 2x}$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$4$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$6$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$8$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$10$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$12$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 2,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Gunakan sifat limit fungsi trigonometri dasar $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\tan ax}{bx} = \\frac{a}{b}$ dan $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin ax}{\\tan bx} = \\frac{a}{b}$:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\left( \\frac{\\tan 8x}{x} \\cdot \\frac{\\sin 2x}{\\tan 2x} \\right) = 8 \\cdot \\frac{2}{2} = 8 \\cdot 1 = 8" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q06",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Diketahui persamaan lingkaran $x^2 + y^2 - 6x + 8y - 11 = 0$. Jarak titik pusat lingkaran tersebut ke garis $4x + 3y - 5 = 0$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$1$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$3$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$4$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$5$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Pusat lingkaran $x^2 + y^2 - 6x + 8y - 11 = 0$ adalah $(3, -4)$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Hitung jarak titik $(3,-4)$ ke garis $4x + 3y - 5 = 0$:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "d = \\frac{|4(3) + 3(-4) - 5|}{\\sqrt{4^2 + 3^2}} = \\frac{|12 - 12 - 5|}{5} = \\frac{|-5|}{5} = 1" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q07",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Turunan pertama dari fungsi $f(x) = x^2 \\sin(2x)$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x \\sin(2x) + 2x^2 \\cos(2x)$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x \\sin(2x) - 2x^2 \\cos(2x)$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x \\cos(2x) + 2x^2 \\sin(2x)$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x \\sin(2x) + x^2 \\cos(2x)$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2x \\cos(2x) - x^2 \\sin(2x)$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Gunakan aturan perkalian turunan $f'(x) = u'v + uv'$:" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Misalkan $u = x^2 \\implies u' = 2x$ dan $v = \\sin(2x) \\implies v' = 2\\cos(2x)$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "f'(x) = (2x)\\sin(2x) + (x^2)(2\\cos(2x)) = 2x\\sin(2x) + 2x^2\\cos(2x)" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q08",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Nilai dari $\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{x^2 - 1}{\\sin(x - 1)}$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$0$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$1$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$2$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$3$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\infty$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 2,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Faktorkan pembilang $(x^2 - 1) = (x-1)(x+1)$:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{(x-1)(x+1)}{\\sin(x-1)} = \\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{x-1}{\\sin(x-1)} \\cdot (x+1)" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Karena $\\lim_{x \\to 1} \\frac{x-1}{\\sin(x-1)} = 1$, maka:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "1 \\cdot (1 + 1) = 2" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q09",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Persamaan garis singgung lingkaran $x^2 + y^2 = 25$ di titik yang berabsis $3$ (di kuadran I) adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$3x + 4y = 25$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$4x + 3y = 25$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$3x - 4y = 25$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$4x - 3y = 25$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$5x + 4y = 25$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Cari koordinat $y$ titik singgung (Kuadran I):" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "3^2 + y^2 = 25 \\implies 9 + y^2 = 25 \\implies y = 4" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Gunakan rumus garis singgung di titik $(x_1, y_1) = (3, 4)$:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "x_1x + y_1y = r^2 \\implies 3x + 4y = 25" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-mat-lanjut-sulit-08-q10",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Diketahui $f(x) = \\frac{x+1}{x-3}$ untuk $x \\ne 3$. Nilai dari $f^{-1}(2)$ adalah ...." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$-7$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$-5$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$0$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$5$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$7$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 4,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Misalkan $f^{-1}(2) = k \\implies f(k) = 2$:" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "\\frac{k+1}{k-3} = 2 \\implies k + 1 = 2(k - 3) \\implies k + 1 = 2k - 6 \\implies k = 7" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Jadi, $f^{-1}(2) = 7$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    }
  ]
}
